NAME: Steps

DESCRIPTION:

Step counter.

Displays and graphs steps and miles for 
the specified day, month, or year.

Select STG (settings) to adjust step 
length, and to adjust max graph values.

The average walking step length is 30 
inches for men and 26 inches for women.
 Actual step length varies.

NOTES:

The Steps service (svcs/Steps/steps.c) 
wakes periodically, and reads the 
Android step counter sensor. If there 
are new steps, the svcs/Steps/steps.dat
file is updated. The steps.dat file 
accumulates steps in hour, day, month, 
and year buckets.

The steps.dat file is a fixed size, and
supports years 2026 through 2045.

The Steps service will accumulate steps 
even when ezApp is in the background or 
when the Android device is sleeping.

The Steps service does not run when 
ezApp is not running.

The Steps app (apps/Steps/steps.c), 
accesses the svcs/Steps/steps.dat file 
by mapping the file into its address 
space.
